cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this formalization, please cite it as below.
title: 'Centrally-Excited-Random-Walk: a Lean 4 formalization of limit shapes of centrally excited random
  walks'
abstract: A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization of Limit shapes for centrally excited walks by Bou-Rabee, Nguyen,
  Peres and Singh (arXiv:2610.10162), and of the two-author manuscript Kozma's centrally excited walk converges
  to a Euclidean ball by Bou-Rabee and Peres. Every theorem, lemma and proposition of the paper is proved, in
  29 checked declarations. The library has no sorry and no custom axiom, and the theorems of the introduction
  are checked independently with Mathlib-only comparator challenges.
type: software
authors:
